  [1mkeys and commands[0m

  [36m  enter           [39msend what you typed; while a turn runs it is queued as a follow-up
  [36m  alt+enter       [39ma newline inside the prompt, without sending it
  [36m  esc esc         [39minterrupt the running turn — twice, within five seconds
  [36m  ctrl-c          [39mclear what you typed; twice on an empty prompt, within a second, quits
  [36m  ↑ ↓             [39mmove inside the prompt, then walk the prompts you have sent
  [36m  pgup pgdn       [39mscroll the transcript; esc returns to following the stream
  [36m  wheel           [39mscroll the transcript; shift+drag selects text
  [36m  ctrl-a ctrl-e   [39mstart and end of the line; ctrl-w and ctrl-u kill, ctrl-y yanks
  [36m  ctrl-z          [39mundo — a word at a time, and a kill is always its own step
  [36m  paste           [39mfive lines or more collapses to a marker and is sent in full
  [36m  ctrl-s          [39mthe session list: type a number or part of a name to switch
  [36m  tab             [39mcomplete the /command being typed; more tabs walk the matches
  [36m  click           [39min the session list, picks the row under the pointer; enter still switches
  [36m  ctrl-p          [39mthe todos pane: the model's plan, and the repo's TODO.md read-only — ↑↓ moves, enter or tab unfolds an item, pgup/pgdn scrolls
  [36m  /new [title]    [39mstart a session in this daemon and go there
  [36m  /switch WHAT    [39mgo to a session by number, id or part of its name
  [36m  ctrl-r          [39mfold or unfold the model's thinking
  [36m  ctrl-t          [39mfold or unfold tool output
  [36m  ctrl-x          [39mshow the raw <function=…> text of tool calls, as the model wrote it
  [36m  ctrl-l          [39mrepaint the screen
  [36m  /status         [39mthis head's counters — dropped, scrubbed, resync — and what each means
  [36m  /verbosity      [39mterse → normal → loud; /status counts what has been filtered
  [36m  /interrupt      [39minterrupt, when a key is awkward
  [36m  /compact        [39msummarize this session down to one record; the old transcript is forked, not lost
  [36m  /mode           [39mmove this project to a point: read-only, always-ask, writes-allowed, automode, automode-edits, allow-all (next session)
  [36m  /supervise      [39mthe guard model answers every gated call before you do, from the next call — on, off, status
  [36m  /gate           [39mwhat the gate decided, and rule on it afterwards: recent, todo, corpus, ok|grant|revoke ID
  [36m  /flowy          [39mthe seat on the fabric: /flowy status · /flowy login [SEAT] [--token T] · /flowy logout
  [36m  /models         [39mwhich model answers: /models lists them with their auth; /models deepseek/deepseek-chat switches and sticks; /models local
  [36m  /job            [39mread a background job's output: /job lists them, /job ID prints it, --offset N resumes
  [36m  /tools          [39mthe tools seated here — and any the prompt has never been told about, which the model cannot call
  [36m  /default-model  [39mwhat a NEW session starts on: /default-model PROVIDER/MODEL, or `local` to clear it. Not this conversation — that is /models
  [36m  /resync         [39mthrow this head's state away and take a fresh snapshot
  [36m  /quit           [39mdetach. The turn keeps running: idle means quiet, not unwatched

